[size=5][b][color=#ffb547]What it is[/color][/b][/size]

CBBE's women have closed skin where the genitals should be, and no bones there for physics to move. Anatomy gives them real geometry (Nahka's, aligned to today's CBBE), adds the bones at run time, and lets the [b]Anatomy Engine[/b] (fo4-ocbpc) open the body by contact, never by posing. [b]No body ships in the download:[/b] the Anatomy Builder makes it on your PC from the CBBE, skin and skeleton you already have, and stops at any stage that can't prove itself. Nahka's work ships only as a patch, with her permission.

[size=5][b][color=#ffb547]What you get[/color][/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]The body.[/b] 22,488 of its vertices are exactly CBBE's, so every preset and morph still fits; the genitals meet the skin with no visible seam, and their texture is matched to your skin's tone without touching your skin files. A BodySlide slider, "Opening, front", shows a little more from the front.
[*][b]A softer hip.[/b] CBBE's skinning tore the inner hip in legs-up poses: the worst stretch fell from 11.1x to 4.0x.
[*][b]Physics that opens the body.[/b] The openings open because contact pushes them. Outer lips jiggle when walking or thrusting and squish aside under a hand or shaft. The anus opens on its real ring. Skeletons with no genital bones used to tear ("fins"): kneeling 2,613 torn edges → 0.
[*][b]Contact as one smooth tube[/b], not a string of balls: no more flesh riding in and out along a thrust.
[*][b]The penis finds its opening[/b] (in AAF scenes): vagina, anus or mouth, whichever the pose implies, bending along her canal, following her throat, or passing through a gripping hand. Every man gets a thinner shaft and a bigger head, on BodyTalk4 without touching its files, and a slightly redder glans (LooksMenu).
[*][b]The mouth opens to what is in it[/b], lips fit around the shape and close between strokes, and her face reacts while her mouth is busy.
[*][b]Arousal.[/b] Every 3 seconds each woman nearby moves toward her strongest cause (being in a scene, watching one, a companion's desire, being naked) and is halfway back down a minute after it is gone. Her nipples follow, on top of her own body.
[*][b]With Rapport:[/b] Rapport's face is the one that shows in every AAF scene, and she looks into her partner's eyes for 4-7 seconds now and then.
[/list]

