[size=5][b][color=#ffb547]Anatomy Rebuild[/color][/b] (optional download)[/size]

Run [font=Courier New]AnatomyRebuild.exe[/font] after every BodySlide build and your outfits get the body's hip fix, so they stop parting from the skin at the groin in legs-up poses (a combat-armour leg on all fours: worst gap 5.10 → 2.25). It also removes the neck seam line. It never runs BodySlide and never moves a vertex, a morph or a slider, so any preset works, zaps included. [font=Courier New]--undo[/font] puts your builds back.

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy@276c3dc7df3ebbd7c28f53eeda1073ecfa0be936/docs/img/outfits.jpg[/img][/center]

[size=5][b][color=#ffb547]Install[/color][/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*]Install the [b]Anatomy Engine[/b] (fo4-ocbpc), then Anatomy.
[*]Run [font=Courier New]Data\Tools\AnatomyBuilder\AnatomyBuilder.exe[/font] once. On MO2, run it from MO2, like BodySlide.
[*]In BodySlide, pick "Anatomy Body" and your preset, then Build.
[*]Optional: run Anatomy Rebuild after every BodySlide build.
[/list]
Run the builder again after changing your CBBE or skin mod.

[quote]
[b]Needs:[/b] Fallout 4 1.10.163 (Steam or GOG, not next-gen), F4SE 0.6.23, the Anatomy Engine (fo4-ocbpc), CBBE with its BodySlide files, and BodySlide. LooksMenu (nipples, glans colour), AAF (scenes) and MCM (settings) for the parts that use them.

[b]Nothing of another mod is overwritten.[/b] Anatomy's physics lines sit in their own folder and are read after yours; the builder writes only new files, each in one step, and stops with a clear message rather than guess.
[/quote]

[size=5][b][color=#ffb547]FAQ[/color][/b][/size]

[b]Is everything tested in game?[/b]
[spoiler]Most of it. Built and tested offline, but not yet seen in game: fisting and big-toy stretch, toys colliding as one tube, Rapport's MCM knobs for the physics, and the brows following vaginal and anal depth (the oral ones are confirmed). Known limits: in a two-hole position the aim chooses by geometry alone, men's own openings are not modelled, and the wrist can show a faint line against the hands. If you see any of this, please tell us.[/spoiler]

[b]Why are there .exe files?[/b]
[spoiler]The Anatomy Builder and Anatomy Rebuild are Python tools packed to run without installing Python. Their source is in [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-anatomy]the public repository[/url] ([font=Courier New]tools/builder.py[/font], [font=Courier New]tools/rebuild.py[/font]).[/spoiler]

[b]Does it work with my other mods?[/b]
[spoiler]AAF and UAP, LooksMenu, Rapport, Silhouette (nipples stay flat under heavy armour it marks), Overture and Ivy (arousal sources), CBBE HeadRear Absolute Fix, any OCBPC physics config, and BodyTalk4 men.[/spoiler]

[b]Where are the settings?[/b]
[spoiler]MCM, page "Anatomy": the arousal nipples and their strength, rise and fade speed, each arousal source, and the glans colour. The sticky posts list every feature and setting.[/spoiler]

